		{"name":"ifbigfont"},
		{"name":"iffussydescription","hidden":true},
		{"name":"includequestion","args":[{"kind":"o"},{"kind":"m","role":"file","loads":true,"ext":".tex","appends":"missing"}]},
		{"name":"italicpi","if":"uprightpi|stix2","doc":"If the option uprightpi is present, then \\pi is defined to produce an upright letter, and the command \\italicpi is defined to produce the slanted version."},
		{"name":"leftnudge","args":[{"kind":"m"}],"doc":"You should call the \\leftnudge command to do this, rather than fiddling with the underlying LaTeX dimensions yourself. Give the command a dimension argument such as \\leftnudge{1cm} to nudge the textblock leftwards by 1cm."},
